{
  "message": "Starting the Parcelly ↔ Spokes integration. I've analyzed Parcelly's shipment API (parcel/pallet, Polish couriers, idempotency, signed webhooks) and Spokes' payment webhook expectations (POST /orders/{id}/pay, ORD-<number> IDs). Key mismatches: Spokes expects payment confirmations at /orders/{id}/pay, but Parcelly emits shipment.status_changed events; Spokes needs to know the exact order ID format for webhook construction; Spokes asks about signature headers and refund/cancellation notifications. I've drafted schemas, operations, webhooks, secrets, decisions, and provider scenarios covering Parcelly's real rules. Please review the decisions — especially D1 (webhook path mapping), D2 (order ID format), D3 (refund/cancellation), D4 (idempotency header requirement), D5 (size-weight validation), D6 (postcode-city validation) — and pick the default option for each.",
  "patches": [
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/environments",
      "value": {
        "provider_base_url": "${PROVIDER_BASE_URL}",
        "consumer_webhook_url": "${CONSUMER_WEBHOOK_URL}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/secrets",
      "value": [
        {
          "name": "partner_api_key",
          "description": "Bearer token for partner authentication at Parcelly API"
        },
        {
          "name": "webhook_secret",
          "description": "HMAC-SHA256 secret for signing webhook payloads"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/glossary",
      "value": {
        "parcel": "Small shipment up to 25 kg, sizes A/B/C",
        "pallet": "Heavy shipment 25–1000 kg, EUR pallet type",
        "groszy": "1/100 PLN, integer currency unit used in charges",
        "partner": "Spokes (bike shop) as a Parcelly API partner",
        "reference": "Spokes' order ID (e.g., ORD-1001) passed as shipment.reference"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/schemas",
      "value": {
        "CreateParcelRequest": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "reference",
            "receiver",
            "parcel"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "reference": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Spokes order ID, format ORD-<number>"
            },
            "receiver": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "name",
                "phone",
                "address"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "name": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "phone": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "pattern": "^\\+48\\d{9}$"
                },
                "address": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "street",
                    "building",
                    "postcode",
                    "city",
                    "country"
                  ],
                  "additionalProperties": false,
                  "properties": {
                    "street": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "building": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "flat": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "nullable": true
                    },
                    "postcode": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "pattern": "^\\d{2}-\\d{3}$"
                    },
                    "city": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "country": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "enum": [
                        "PL"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "parcel": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "weight_g",
                "size"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "weight_g": {
                  "type": "integer",
                  "minimum": 1,
                  "maximum": 25000
                },
                "size": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "A",
                    "B",
                    "C"
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "CreatePalletRequest": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "reference",
            "receiver",
            "pallet"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "reference": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "receiver": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "name",
                "phone",
                "address"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "name": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "phone": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "pattern": "^\\+48\\d{9}$"
                },
                "address": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "street",
                    "building",
                    "postcode",
                    "city",
                    "country"
                  ],
                  "additionalProperties": false,
                  "properties": {
                    "street": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "building": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "flat": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "nullable": true
                    },
                    "postcode": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "pattern": "^\\d{2}-\\d{3}$"
                    },
                    "city": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "country": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "enum": [
                        "PL"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "pallet": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "weight_g",
                "pallet_type"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "weight_g": {
                  "type": "integer",
                  "minimum": 25001,
                  "maximum": 1000000
                },
                "pallet_type": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "EUR"
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "ShipmentResponse": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "id",
            "reference",
            "status",
            "service",
            "price_gr",
            "receiver",
            "created_at",
            "updated_at"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "id": {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^shp_\\d+$"
            },
            "reference": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "status": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "CREATED",
                "COLLECTED",
                "IN_TRANSIT",
                "DELIVERED",
                "RETURNED"
              ]
            },
            "service": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "parcel",
                "pallet"
              ]
            },
            "tracking_number": {
              "type": "string",
              "nullable": true
            },
            "price_gr": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 0
            },
            "receiver": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "name",
                "phone",
                "address"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "name": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "phone": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "address": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "street",
                    "building",
                    "postcode",
                    "city",
                    "country"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "street": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "building": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "flat": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "nullable": true
                    },
                    "postcode": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "city": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "country": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "parcel": {
              "type": "object",
              "nullable": true,
              "properties": {
                "weight_g": {
                  "type": "integer"
                },
                "size": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "A",
                    "B",
                    "C"
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            "pallet": {
              "type": "object",
              "nullable": true,
              "properties": {
                "weight_g": {
                  "type": "integer"
                },
                "pallet_type": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "EUR"
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            "created_at": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "date-time"
            },
            "updated_at": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "date-time"
            }
          }
        },
        "ErrorResponse": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "code",
            "message"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "code": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "INVALID_JSON",
                "INVALID_REQUEST",
                "INVALID_IDEMPOTENCY_KEY",
                "UNAUTHORIZED",
                "INVALID_PHONE",
                "INVALID_POSTCODE",
                "WEIGHT_LIMIT_EXCEEDED",
                "SIZE_WEIGHT_MISMATCH",
                "POSTCODE_CITY_MISMATCH",
                "PALLET_WEIGHT_OUT_OF_RANGE",
                "SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND",
                "REFERENCE_REQUIRED"
              ]
            },
            "message": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        },
        "WebhookRegistrationRequest": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "url",
            "secret"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "url": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uri"
            },
            "secret": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 16
            }
          }
        },
        "WebhookRegistrationResponse": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "url",
            "secret"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "url": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "secret": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        },
        "ShipmentStatusChangedEvent": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "event",
            "shipment_id",
            "reference",
            "status",
            "occurred_at"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "event": {
              "type": "string",
              "const": "shipment.status_changed"
            },
            "shipment_id": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "reference": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "status": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "CREATED",
                "COLLECTED",
                "IN_TRANSIT",
                "DELIVERED",
                "RETURNED"
              ]
            },
            "occurred_at": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "date-time"
            }
          }
        },
        "GetShipmentByReferenceResponse": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "id",
            "reference",
            "status",
            "service",
            "price_gr",
            "receiver",
            "created_at",
            "updated_at"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "id": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "reference": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "status": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "CREATED",
                "COLLECTED",
                "IN_TRANSIT",
                "DELIVERED",
                "RETURNED"
              ]
            },
            "service": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "parcel",
                "pallet"
              ]
            },
            "tracking_number": {
              "type": "string",
              "nullable": true
            },
            "price_gr": {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "receiver": {
              "type": "object"
            },
            "parcel": {
              "type": "object",
              "nullable": true
            },
            "pallet": {
              "type": "object",
              "nullable": true
            },
            "created_at": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "date-time"
            },
            "updated_at": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "date-time"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/operations",
      "value": {
        "create_parcel": {
          "description": "Create a new parcel shipment (1–25000 g). Idempotency-Key header prevents duplicate charges.",
          "direction": "consumer_to_provider",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "path": "/v1/shipments",
            "headers": {
              "Authorization": {
                "required": true,
                "pattern": "^Bearer .+$"
              },
              "Idempotency-Key": {
                "required": false,
                "pattern": "^.{1,255}$"
              }
            },
            "body": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/CreateParcelRequest"
            }
          },
          "responses": {
            "201": {
              "body": {
                "$ref": "#/schemas/ShipmentResponse"
              }
            },
            "400": {
              "body": {
                "$ref": "#/schemas/ErrorResponse"
              }
            },
            "401": {
              "body": {
                "$ref": "#/schemas/ErrorResponse"
              }
            },
            "422": {
              "body": {
                "$ref": "#/schemas/ErrorResponse"
              }
            }
          },
          "stub": {
            "default_status": 201,
            "body": {
              "id": "shp_{{seq}}",
              "reference": "{{request.body.reference}}",
              "status": "CREATED",
              "service": "parcel",
              "tracking_number": "PCL{{seq}}PL",
              "price_gr": 1299,
              "receiver": "{{request.body.receiver}}",
              "parcel": "{{request.body.parcel}}",
              "pallet": null,
              "created_at": "{{now}}",
              "updated_at": "{{now}}"
            },
            "idempotent_on_header": "Idempotency-Key"
          }
        },
        "create_pallet": {
          "description": "Create a new pallet shipment (25001–1000000 g).",
          "direction": "consumer_to_provider",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "path": "/v1/pallets",
            "headers": {
              "Authorization": {
                "required": true,
                "pattern": "^Bearer .+$"
              },
              "Idempotency-Key": {
                "required": false,
                "pattern": "^.{1,255}$"
              }
            },
            "body": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/CreatePalletRequest"
            }
          },
          "responses": {
            "201": {
              "body": {
                "$ref": "#/schemas/ShipmentResponse"
              }
            },
            "400": {
              "body": {
                "$ref": "#/schemas/ErrorResponse"
              }
            },
            "401": {
              "body": {
                "$ref": "#/schemas/ErrorResponse"
              }
            },
            "422": {
              "body": {
                "$ref": "#/schemas/ErrorResponse"
              }
            }
          },
          "stub": {
            "default_status": 201,
            "body": {
              "id": "shp_{{seq}}",
              "reference": "{{request.body.reference}}",
              "status": "CREATED",
              "service": "pallet",
              "tracking_number": "PAL{{seq}}PL",
              "price_gr": 50000,
              "receiver": "{{request.body.receiver}}",
              "parcel": null,
              "pallet": "{{request.body.pallet}}",
              "created_at": "{{now}}",
              "updated_at": "{{now}}"
            },
            "idempotent_on_header": "Idempotency-Key"
          }
        },
        "register_webhook": {
          "description": "Register or replace the partner's webhook URL and signing secret.",
          "direction": "consumer_to_provider",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "path": "/v1/webhooks",
            "headers": {
              "Authorization": {
                "required": true,
                "pattern": "^Bearer .+$"
              }
            },
            "body": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/WebhookRegistrationRequest"
            }
          },
          "responses": {
            "200": {
              "body": {
                "$ref": "#/schemas/WebhookRegistrationResponse"
              }
            },
            "400": {
              "body": {
                "$ref": "#/schemas/ErrorResponse"
              }
            },
            "401": {
              "body": {
                "$ref": "#/schemas/ErrorResponse"
              }
            }
          },
          "stub": {
            "default_status": 200,
            "body": {
              "url": "{{request.body.url}}",
              "secret": "{{request.body.secret}}"
            }
          }
        },
        "get_shipment_by_reference": {
          "description": "Retrieve the most recent shipment for a given partner reference.",
          "direction": "consumer_to_provider",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "path": "/v1/shipments",
            "headers": {
              "Authorization": {
                "required": true,
                "pattern": "^Bearer .+$"
              }
            },
            "query": {
              "reference": {
                "type": "string",
                "required": true
              }
            }
          },
          "responses": {
            "200": {
              "body": {
                "$ref": "#/schemas/GetShipmentByReferenceResponse"
              }
            },
            "400": {
              "body": {
                "$ref": "#/schemas/ErrorResponse"
              }
            },
            "401": {
              "body": {
                "$ref": "#/schemas/ErrorResponse"
              }
            },
            "404": {
              "body": {
                "$ref": "#/schemas/ErrorResponse"
              }
            }
          },
          "stub": {
            "default_status": 200,
            "body": {
              "id": "shp_1",
              "reference": "{{request.query.reference}}",
              "status": "CREATED",
              "service": "parcel",
              "tracking_number": "PCL1PL",
              "price_gr": 1299,
              "receiver": {
                "name": "Jan Kowalski",
                "phone": "+48600100200",
                "address": {
                  "street": "Długa",
                  "building": "5",
                  "flat": "3",
                  "postcode": "00-001",
                  "city": "Warszawa",
                  "country": "PL"
                }
              },
              "parcel": {
                "weight_g": 1200,
                "size": "A"
              },
              "pallet": null,
              "created_at": "2026-10-06T10:00:00.000Z",
              "updated_at": "2026-10-06T10:00:00.000Z"
            }
          }
        },
        "get_shipment_by_id": {
          "description": "Retrieve a specific shipment by its Parcelly ID.",
          "direction": "consumer_to_provider",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "path": "/v1/shipments/{id}",
            "headers": {
              "Authorization": {
                "required": true,
                "pattern": "^Bearer .+$"
              }
            }
          },
          "responses": {
            "200": {
              "body": {
                "$ref": "#/schemas/ShipmentResponse"
              }
            },
            "401": {
              "body": {
                "$ref": "#/schemas/ErrorResponse"
              }
            },
            "404": {
              "body": {
                "$ref": "#/schemas/ErrorResponse"
              }
            }
          },
          "stub": {
            "default_status": 200,
            "body": {
              "id": "{{request.path.id}}",
              "reference": "ORD-1001",
              "status": "CREATED",
              "service": "parcel",
              "tracking_number": "PCL1PL",
              "price_gr": 1299,
              "receiver": {
                "name": "Jan Kowalski",
                "phone": "+48600100200",
                "address": {
                  "street": "Długa",
                  "building": "5",
                  "flat": "3",
                  "postcode": "00-001",
                  "city": "Warszawa",
                  "country": "PL"
                }
              },
              "parcel": {
                "weight_g": 1200,
                "size": "A"
              },
              "pallet": null,
              "created_at": "2026-10-06T10:00:00.000Z",
              "updated_at": "2026-10-06T10:00:00.000Z"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/webhooks",
      "value": {
        "shipment_status_changed": {
          "description": "Emitted when a shipment changes status (CREATED → COLLECTED → IN_TRANSIT → DELIVERED/RETURNED). Signed with HMAC-SHA256.",
          "direction": "provider_to_consumer",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "${CONSUMER_WEBHOOK_URL}",
            "headers": {
              "X-Signature": {
                "required": true,
                "pattern": "^sha256=[0-9a-f]{64}$"
              },
              "Content-Type": {
                "required": true,
                "pattern": "^application/json$"
              }
            },
            "body": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/ShipmentStatusChangedEvent"
            }
          },
          "signature": {
            "algorithm": "hmac-sha256",
            "header": "X-Signature",
            "format": "sha256={hex}",
            "over": "raw_body",
            "secret": "webhook_secret"
          },
          "consumer_responses": {
            "valid_signature": 200,
            "invalid_signature": 401
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/semantic_mappings",
      "value": {
        "shipment_status_to_order_status": {
          "CREATED": "shipped",
          "COLLECTED": "shipped",
          "IN_TRANSIT": "shipped",
          "DELIVERED": "delivered",
          "RETURNED": "cancelled"
        },
        "parcelly_error_to_spokes_error": {
          "INVALID_PHONE": "INVALID_PHONE",
          "INVALID_POSTCODE": "INVALID_POSTCODE",
          "WEIGHT_LIMIT_EXCEEDED": "WEIGHT_LIMIT_EXCEEDED",
          "SIZE_WEIGHT_MISMATCH": "SIZE_WEIGHT_MISMATCH",
          "POSTCODE_CITY_MISMATCH": "POSTCODE_CITY_MISMATCH",
          "SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND": "ORDER_NOT_FOUND"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/decisions",
      "value": [
        {
          "id": "D1",
          "text": "Webhook path mapping: Parcelly emits shipment.status_changed to a single configured webhook URL. Spokes expects payment confirmations at POST /orders/{id}/pay. We need a mapping layer. Option A: Spokes registers a webhook endpoint that accepts shipment.status_changed and internally maps to /orders/{id}/pay. Option B: Parcelly adds a dedicated payment-confirmation webhook type (new feature). Option C: Spokes uses a generic webhook receiver that transforms events.",
          "owner": "consumer"
        },
        {
          "id": "D2",
          "text": "Order ID format in webhook: Spokes needs the exact order ID format to construct /orders/{id}/pay. Parcelly passes Spokes' reference field (e.g., ORD-1001) unchanged in shipment.reference and webhook.reference. Confirm Spokes' order IDs are exactly ORD-<number> and will be used as-is.",
          "owner": "consumer"
        },
        {
          "id": "D3",
          "text": "Refund/cancellation notifications: Spokes asks if Parcelly sends refund or cancellation webhooks. Parcelly has RETURNED status (shipment returned to sender) but no explicit refund event. Option A: Map RETURNED → cancellation notification via shipment.status_changed. Option B: Parcelly adds a separate refund/cancellation webhook type (new feature). Option C: Spokes polls GET /v1/shipments?reference= for RETURNED status.",
          "owner": "consumer"
        },
        {
          "id": "D4",
          "text": "Idempotency-Key requirement: Parcelly treats blank/missing Idempotency-Key as no key (each request creates new shipment + charge). Spokes' payment endpoint requires idempotency. Option A: Spokes must always send Idempotency-Key (e.g., its order ID) when creating shipments. Option B: Parcelly adds a partner flag require_idempotency_key to enforce it. Option C: Document as best practice only.",
          "owner": "provider"
        },
